@startuml
title Application 2 - CV parsing + GitHub skill extraction and embedding

skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #F4F8FF
  BorderColor #2C5AA0
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFF6E0
  DiamondBorderColor #B8860B
}

|Candidate / API|
start
:candidate applies
(upload CV, optional GitHub URL);

|CV Parser Service|
:extract text from CV (PDF / DOCX);

fork
  :LLM parse CV
  (skills, experience, projects, seniority);
fork again
  :enrich from GitHub
  (repo languages, frameworks, tech_stats
  with last_used_year and years);
end fork

:merge CV skills + GitHub skills
(attach recency and duration);

while (more extracted skills?) is (yes)
  :take next skill;

  |Skill Catalog (pgvector)|
  :Resolve skill vector
  (call "Resolve Skill Vector" sub-activity);
  note right
    same dedup path as the job offer:
    embed -> pgvector NN search ->
    merge with existing or create NEW skill
  end note

endwhile (no)

|CV Parser Service|
:store candidate skill vectors
(cached for semantic matching);
stop

@enduml
